<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Choose Student</title>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Darker+Grotesque:wght@400;600&display=swap');

    * {
      font-family: 'Darker Grotesque', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      overflow-x: hidden;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #B82121;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .first-main {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    .first-main .photo-main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      margin-right: 0;
    }

    .first-main .choose-main {
      margin-left: 10rem;
      margin-right: 20rem;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .first-main {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo-choose-main {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      margin-left: 2rem;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .logo-choose-main img {
      width: 321px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .logo-choose-main p {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .choose-main {
      margin-top: 10rem;
    }

    .choose-student-box-main {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 40px 36px 32px 36px;
      min-width: 320px;
      max-width: 350px;
      width: 100%;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .student-cards-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .student-card {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.2rem 1.2rem 0.7rem 1.2rem;
      width: 100px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }


    .student-card img {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 50%;
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }

    .student-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 0.2rem 0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #0B364C;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .missing-student {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .missing-student a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: underline;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .second-main {
      margin-top: 10rem;
      margin-bottom: 10rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background-color: #B82121;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .second-main p {
      margin-top: 3%;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 5px;
      border-color: #0B364C;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 43px;
    }

    .footer {
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      background: #0B364C;
      color: #fff;
      z-index: 1000;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
  
      padding: 0;
      height: 64px;
    }

    .footer .socials {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .footer .socials img {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
      transition: filter 0.2s;
    }

    .footer .socials img:hover {
      filter: brightness(0.8) invert(0.7) sepia(1) saturate(5) hue-rotate(180deg);
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-family: 'Darker Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .logo-choose-main p {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .choose-main{
      text-align: center;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;

    }


    .student-cards-row {
      margin-left: 3rem;
    }

    .missing-student {
      margin-left: 3rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }






  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="first-main">
    <div class="photo-main">
      <img src="/assets/PNG_images/image 20.png" alt="" srcset="">
    </div>
    <div class="choose-main">
      <div class="logo-choose-main">
        <img src="/assets/PNG_images/Frame 6.png" alt="Diana-platform-logo">
        <p>Welcome to Diana: the St. Paul’s School Parent’s Portal!</p>
        <p>Please, select the student access below:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="choose-student-box-main">
        <div class="student-cards-row">
          <div class="student-card" onclick="selecionarFilho('Julio')">
            <img src="/assets/PNG_images/avatar.png" alt="Julio" />
            <h3>Zachary</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="student-card" onclick="selecionarFilho('Henry')">
            <img src="/assets/PNG_images/avatar.png" alt="Henry" />
            <h3>Henry</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="student-card" onclick="selecionarFilho('Olivia')">
            <img src="/assets/PNG_images/avatar.png" alt="Olivia" />
            <h3>Olivia</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="student-card" onclick="selecionarFilho('Amelia')">
            <img src="/assets/PNG_images/avatar.png" alt="Amelia" />
            <h3>Amelia</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="missing-student">
          Missing student?<br>
          <a href="#">Click to talk with the support team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="second-main">
    <img src="/assets/PNG_images/BRAND_ST PAULS_White Outline (2) 1.png">
    <p>We are the British school of São Paulo. At St. Paul’s we always strive to be the best we can be. We have the
      courage of our convictions, essential <br> values, and the freedom to imagine and create. This is achieved through
      our
      high-quality British and Brazilian holistic education which <br> drives the personal and academic development of
      pupils, within a caring, inclusive and united community.  </p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <div class="socials">
      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.stpauls.br/"><img src="/assets/PNG_images/St._Paul's_School_new_logo_2016 1.png"
          alt="st-pauls-loog"></a>
      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.instagram.com/stpaulsschoolsp/?hl=pt"><img
          src="/assets/PNG_images/Instagram Old.png" alt="instagram"></a>
      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/StPaulsschoolSP/?locale=pt_BR"><img
          src="/assets/PNG_images/Facebook.png" alt="facebook"></a>
      <a target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/stpaulsschool/people/?originalSubdomain=br"><img
          src="/assets/PNG_images/linkedin.png" alt="linkedin"></a>
    </div>
    <p>Copyright © 2025 Saint Pauls. All rights reserved. Privacy Policy. All rights reserved by Saint Paul.</p>
  </div>
  <script>
    function selecionarFilho(nome) {
      window.location.href = `/assignments`;
    }
  </script>
</body>

</html>